---
const navItems = [
  { href: "#", label: "TOP", spOnly: true },
  { href: "#profile", label: "OWNER'S PROFILE" },
  { href: "#feature", label: "FEATURE" },
  { href: "#members-voice", label: "MEMBER'S VOICE" },
  { href: "#price", label: "PRICE" },
  { href: "#qa", label: "Q&A" },
  { href: "#access", label: "ACCESS" },
];

const snsItems = [
  {
    href: "https://www.youtube.com/",
    label: "YouTube",
    img: "/mock_site/MELIAFITNESS/images/icon-youtube.webp",
  },
  {
    href: "https://twitter.com/",
    label: "Twitter",
    img: "/mock_site/MELIAFITNESS/images/icon-twitter.webp",
  },
  {
    href: "https://www.instagram.com/",
    label: "Instagram",
    img: "/mock_site/MELIAFITNESS/images/icon-instagram.webp",
  },
];
---

<footer class="mf-footer">
  <!-- Left column: Logo + Note -->
  <div class="mf-footer__left">
    <div class="mf-footer__logo">
      <a href="#" aria-label="MELIA FITNESS トップへ">
        <img
          src="/mock_site/MELIAFITNESS/images/footer-logo.webp"
          alt="MELIA FITNESS"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </a>
    </div>
    <p class="mf-footer__note">
      このサイトはMELINDA様のご協力のもと作成したコーディング用の練習課題です。実在の人物・団体とは関係ありません。
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Right column: Nav + SNS + Copyright -->
  <div class="mf-footer__right">
    <!-- Nav -->
    <nav class="mf-footer__nav" aria-label="フッターナビゲーション">
      {navItems.filter(({ spOnly }) => !spOnly).map(({ href, label }) => <a href={href}>{label}</a>)}
    </nav>

    <!-- SNS -->
    <ul class="mf-footer__sns" aria-label="ソーシャルメディア">
      {
        snsItems.map(({ href, label, img }) => (
          <li>
            <a
              href={href}
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              aria-label={label}
            >
              <img src={img} alt="" width="40" height="40" loading="lazy" />
            </a>
          </li>
        ))
      }
    </ul>

    <!-- Copyright -->
    <p class="mf-footer__copyright">&copy; 2021 MELIA FITNESS</p>
  </div>

  <!-- SP only: Nav (with TOP) + SNS + Copyright -->
  <div class="mf-footer__sp">
    <nav class="mf-footer__nav-sp" aria-label="フッターナビゲーション（SP）">
      {navItems.map(({ href, label }) => <a href={href}>{label}</a>)}
    </nav>
    <ul class="mf-footer__sns mf-footer__sns--sp" aria-label="ソーシャルメディア（SP）">
      {
        snsItems.map(({ href, label, img }) => (
          <li>
            <a
              href={href}
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              aria-label={label}
            >
              <img src={img} alt="" width="40" height="40" loading="lazy" />
            </a>
          </li>
        ))
      }
    </ul>
    <p class="mf-footer__note mf-footer__note--sp">
      このサイトはMELINDA様のご協力のもと作成したコーディング用の練習課題です。実在の人物・団体とは関係ありません。
    </p>
    <p class="mf-footer__copyright mf-footer__copyright--sp">&copy; 2021 MELIA FITNESS</p>
  </div>
</footer>
